    "message": "Read only fork receipts when comparing branches\n\nThe synchronized comparison, fetched for every played minute in compare\nmode, decoded and validated each branch's whole checkpoint just to read\nruntime_state.fork_origin. Read the head's verified runtime_state field\ninstead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
