    "message": "Check report and conversation routes with the branch pointer\n\nGET report, which the UI requests as soon as a run completes, and GET\nconversations decoded and validated the whole head checkpoint only to\nconfirm the branch exists. Read the branch pointer instead, as the\nllm-status route already does.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
