    "message": "Check result Q&A completion with the branch pointer\n\nCollecting Q&A evidence decoded and validated the whole head checkpoint\nonly to compare its minute with the duration. Compare the pointer's\ncomputed_until with the immutable Scenario duration instead.\n\nAdd regressions that comparisons, report, conversations and the Q&A\ncompletion check no longer decode a checkpoint.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
